{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:19:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_8d4401d8b3644dac8cca4642992bb6a8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_71395645f768abdd863a4e73ce3d0e39ecd736fa1d759025027c0aa4b3667977","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"timvw/tmux-assistant-resurrect@4d740923614a snapshot 819817bffcc019b3","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6a364bfa6145cb4396026e98a5c8191d26a6b621869096e72f0aeb3ea5f45493"],"source_ids":["src_83420083763d561d8bfa6086401cb304"],"text":"The save hook sweeps state files whose process has exited on every run, so the state directory does not grow without bound; the persistent sidecar assistant-sessions.json is what restore reads.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:19:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8d4401d8b3644dac8cca4642992bb6a8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:19:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_8d4401d8b3644dac8cca4642992bb6a8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_79199f603a043259d0c68cb23f64d22c70a30a9f777242e3fe58a18d2661e44f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"timvw/tmux-assistant-resurrect@4d740923614a snapshot 819817bffcc019b3","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2ee70994147fdeccb77912540f4c26d8c16147cb1295a6b64e967643256cce27","slc_5e34bda5e8a2359a03f19cf0fa5f7b1198f6222e6026f6568da730bc407df2bb"],"source_ids":["src_83420083763d561d8bfa6086401cb304"],"text":"Prerequisites are tmux (tested 3.4-3.7), TPM, jq, and at least one supported assistant CLI; the plugin also integrates with tmux-resurrect and tmux-continuum.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:19:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8d4401d8b3644dac8cca4642992bb6a8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:19:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_8d4401d8b3644dac8cca4642992bb6a8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7c28ede6b860bccaeb08fa5c8cedaa55f1ed530ffa995fee51ddf17f4188ef66","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"timvw/tmux-assistant-resurrect@4d740923614a snapshot 819817bffcc019b3","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_351952cffd8d8911dea7cf5ed893d1306ac2d0f06660579ea70b2af3d33e53c8","slc_a0faed4d67a5776f29a657bbc50b12cafcca75b3d88ef81d5f07aa44b9a462b2","slc_a6daa9fe5f82bf751679073c2d09d4869ebe88bb4011315ef8231cd4d52b29ce","slc_b59d566a35b79040c27f1e9d321697e3e0db4e73e91e1864b8a5874f8e727cb3","slc_bc3ac3d3b03c63014e13b7bd74926abda59decda74b410273ebf34a27da22f51"],"source_ids":["src_83420083763d561d8bfa6086401cb304"],"text":"The plugin exposes tmux options including @assistant-resurrect-capture-env for extra environment variables, per-tool and global drop-flags/drop-env exclusions, @assistant-resurrect-relaunch, and a save-timeout watchdog option.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:19:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8d4401d8b3644dac8cca4642992bb6a8"}
