{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:19:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_8d4401d8b3644dac8cca4642992bb6a8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c87dc7d4735372f543545e2827b0e8d13a4352432c630ff5744436ea00cc8133","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"timvw/tmux-assistant-resurrect@4d740923614a snapshot 819817bffcc019b3","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e3888cf258d157fcf788a3bc67b109457d822de88cd483cd8df14cf7f4b53a8e"],"source_ids":["src_83420083763d561d8bfa6086401cb304"],"text":"Credential-flag stripping matches flag names only, so a secret embedded inside an opaque value (e.g. inside a --settings JSON document) is persisted as written; protection relies on file permissions instead.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:19:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8d4401d8b3644dac8cca4642992bb6a8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:19:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_8d4401d8b3644dac8cca4642992bb6a8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d5ca70b369b3dac6ea6e45ae0a645a5cb66535c66005fd29bd3bf306d631cef4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"timvw/tmux-assistant-resurrect@4d740923614a snapshot 819817bffcc019b3","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4433b979d419727f08ef835155924937a4980ac31ade9cca06bd0139a1447c32"],"source_ids":["src_83420083763d561d8bfa6086401cb304"],"text":"Assistant detection is done by taking a single ps snapshot, finding children of each tmux pane shell, and matching known assistant binary names such as claude, copilot, opencode, codex, pi, omp, and grok.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:19:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8d4401d8b3644dac8cca4642992bb6a8"}
